# Raw studio-master SFX staged from the Sonniss GDC bundle (2026-09-28): 30 s - 4.5 min, up to 90 MB each (416 MB total).
# Kept out of git; the sources live in ~/Documents/GameAudioLibraries/SonnissGDC2026 and are logged in Docs/asset-credits.md.
# Trim/loop-edit a file to a short clip before moving it out of these folders and committing it.
/Assets/Audio/Weather/
/Assets/Audio/Weather.meta
/Assets/Audio/Lab/
/Assets/Audio/Lab.meta

# Third-party source archives and Blender sources (re-downloadable; provenance in Docs/asset-credits.md)
/Assets/ThirdParty/**/*.zip
/Assets/ThirdParty/**/*.zip.meta
/Assets/ThirdParty/**/*.blend
/Assets/ThirdParty/**/*.blend.meta
